      "player": "MiMo Johnny",
      "decision_index": 71,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Attacked with only the Monk Token (2/2 with trample) into Formidable Speaker (2/4), which can block and kill it while taking no trample damage. Meanwhile, Slickshot Show-Off has flying and would deal 1 guaranteed unblockable damage to the opponent at 5 life. The Monk Token is likely to die for nothing if blocked.",
      "action_taken": "Attacked with only the Monk Token 2/2",
      "better_line": "Attack with both creatures (or at minimum Slickshot Show-Off alone). Slickshot's flying guarantees 1 damage, while the Monk Token into a 2/4 blocker likely trades down for nothing. Every point of damage matters with opponent at 5 life.",
      "type": "blunder",
