      "decision_index": 82,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Attacking with the Monk Token (2/2 trample from Cori-Steel Cutter) into Formidable Speaker (2/4) results in the Monk dying for 0 trample damage. With 0 cards in hand, there are no combat tricks to save it. The Monk would be more valuable kept back as a blocker or future attacker with equipment.",
