      "description": "At 5 life facing 3 damage from two attackers (Monk Token 2/2 and Slickshot Show-Off 1/2), MiMo Johnny did not block with available creatures (Formidable Speaker 2/4 and potentially Endurance 3/4). Taking unnecessary damage at such a low life total against a burn deck is dangerous.",
